%N A398758 Primes that occur exactly once in A061026.
%H A398758 Thomas F. Bloom, <a href="https://www.erdosproblems.com/456">Erdős Problem 456</a>, Erdős Problems.
%o A398758 (PARI) a061026(n) = my(m=1); while(eulerphi(m)%n, m++); m;
%o A398758 isok(p) = isprime(p) && sumdiv(p-1, d, a061026(d)==p)==1;
